WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.756 --> 00:00:04.757
Ellen and the prince swam for hours.

2
00:00:04.817 --> 00:00:06.638
They dived and floated.

3
00:00:06.658 --> 00:00:08.919
They played games underwater.

4
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.542
Then the moon began to rise, and they heard voices.

5
00:00:40.723 --> 00:00:42.945
Lights shined through the woods.

6
00:00:42.965 --> 00:00:47.608
"The servants are coming for me," Ellen whispered.

7
00:00:47.628 --> 00:00:51.130
"Too bad because this is delightful."

8
00:00:51.971 --> 00:00:52.892
The prince nodded.

9
00:00:52.912 --> 00:00:55.554
"Swimming with you makes me so happy!

10
00:00:56.314 --> 00:00:57.135
Can we meet again?"

11
00:00:57.155 --> 00:01:01.698
"Perhaps." She looked away.

12
00:01:01.718 --> 00:01:04.540
"But it's not proper to meet alone.

13
00:01:05.492 --> 00:01:08.414
We must keep our meetings a secret."

14
00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:11.756
"Of course," the prince said.

15
00:01:11.776 --> 00:01:17.879
He slipped out of the lake and disappeared into the dark woods.

16
00:01:22.261 --> 00:01:25.203
Early the next morning, the prince returned to the lake.

17
00:01:27.124 --> 00:01:29.045
The princess was already swimming.

18
00:01:29.905 --> 00:01:31.907
The prince longed to join her.

19
00:01:32.847 --> 00:01:34.268
But her parents were with her.

20
00:01:35.744 --> 00:01:38.706
They were in a beautiful boat, drifting on the lake.

21
00:01:38.726 --> 00:01:44.570
"You must wait," he reminded himself, thinking of their secret.

22
00:01:46.512 --> 00:01:49.814
Finally, by late afternoon, Ellen was alone at the lake.

23
00:01:55.438 --> 00:01:58.040
The prince found a tall rock and climbed up.

24
00:01:59.561 --> 00:02:00.822
He began to sing.

25
00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:24.733
swam over, floating below "You have a lovely voice!"

26
00:02:26.314 --> 00:02:26.914
He blushed.

27
00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:28.375
"Thank you.

28
00:02:29.116 --> 00:02:31.117
Would you like to fall into the water with me again?"

29
00:02:31.137 --> 00:02:35.060
"Yes!" Her blue eyes twinkled.

30
00:02:36.928 --> 00:02:38.569
"You must pull me up there first."

31
00:02:39.669 --> 00:02:43.171
The prince took off his scarf and belt and tied them together.

32
00:02:43.791 --> 00:02:45.952
Then he let them down like a rope.

33
00:02:46.572 --> 00:02:50.134
She grabbed on, and he pulled her up to the rock.

34
00:02:53.755 --> 00:02:56.797
They held hands and leaped into the water together.

35
00:03:00.238 --> 00:03:01.979
Ellen laughed with delight.

36
00:03:01.999 --> 00:03:07.932
"What fun!"

37
00:03:07.972 --> 00:03:09.413
Day after day the pair met.

38
00:03:09.954 --> 00:03:12.816
They swam in the lake and talked about everything.

39
00:03:15.318 --> 00:03:16.799
The prince was falling in love.

40
00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:21.082
Ellen was beautiful, and she made him so happy.

41
00:03:24.765 --> 00:03:27.027
He tried to share his feelings with her.

42
00:03:27.127 --> 00:03:29.088
But she just laughed at him.

43
00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:33.952
"I'm serious, Ellen," he said.

44
00:03:37.441 --> 00:03:39.562
She laughed louder and swam away.

45
00:03:44.126 --> 00:03:46.307
The prince sighed and swam after her.

46
00:03:51.411 --> 00:03:55.694
As time went on, the prince saw that Ellen was always lighthearted.

47
00:03:57.916 --> 00:03:59.537
He realized something else too.

48
00:04:01.278 --> 00:04:03.060
She was happiest in the water.

49
00:04:07.012 --> 00:04:09.415
"Someday I will marry her," he thought.

50
00:04:09.435 --> 00:04:13.040
"But we will have to turn into a mermaid and a merman!"
